#, fuzzy
msgid "Intimidating Boss"
msgstr "恐怖魔王"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dark BOSS has returned, even more powerful than before.  You must defeat him "
"to restore peace to our land."
msgstr ""
"黑暗魔王再次歸來，比以往更加強大。擊敗他，才能讓這片土地重獲和平。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I have the rare rockets you seek, but I must know Dark BOSS is defeated "
"before I can part with them."
msgstr ""
"我有你需要的稀有火箭，但在確定黑暗魔王已被擊敗前，還無法交給你。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I am glad to hear of your triumph over Dark BOSS.  Place these rockets in "
"the Mech's inventory to properly use them."
msgstr ""
"聽聞你已擊敗黑暗魔王，我十分欣慰。將這些火箭放入機械寵物的揹包中即可使用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Tell the Source of Life you have slain the Dark BOSS."
msgstr "告訴生命之源，你已經擊敗了黑暗魔王。"

